WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:00.875
To sum up.

2
00:00:00.875 --> 00:00:03.755
You checked eight
fictional A I identities,

3
00:00:03.755 --> 00:00:06.794
filled the sponsor fields
Chapter 2 recorded,

4
00:00:06.794 --> 00:00:10.874
found an orphaned agent and four
top-priority drift findings,

5
00:00:10.874 --> 00:00:13.834
ran the same rules in G
C C High's fallback mode,

6
00:00:13.834 --> 00:00:18.313
and applied a report-only agent policy
to a fake by its approved hash.

7
00:00:18.313 --> 00:00:23.192
The evidence an ISSO keeps from this
module is the A I identities file,

8
00:00:23.192 --> 00:00:28.500
the findings, the orphan candidates,
the policy plan with its approved hash,

9
00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:32.696
and the dry run's and apply's
results and manifests, all dated;

10
00:00:32.696 --> 00:00:37.062
the capability table for decision
D N P six; and the test result.

11
00:00:37.062 --> 00:00:41.450
Next is Module 10: find
drift and file the evidence.

12
00:00:41.450 --> 00:00:45.564
It keeps every gate's state true
against an approved baseline,

13
00:00:45.564 --> 00:00:49.340
and hands the ISSO evidence
they can verify themselves.
